  "rules": [
    "A0IO checks old count exactly15 then resets; otherwise increments, even without the ability or after cap2. Fresh units therefore spawn at weapon-damage events16 and32.",
    "Skin rawcodes h2A8 and h2A9 spawn h2AC, all other carriers spawn n0SD. New summoned bodies inherit owner, position, facing and userData, not bonuses or the chase target.",
    "A0IN selects the shared elseif before mutation: mana!=15 and positive ability level. Add1 clamped, request thunderclap only if resulting mana==15.",
    "A0J5 no longer uses generic proximity auto-casting. Explicit damage50, area300, mana15; AHtc duration is not a stun declaration.",
    "A116 has no supplied healing/area/target values. Reclassified unresolved instead of claiming an implemented zero-effect aura.",
    "A0IP string7 death branch is Skeleton Warlock living bomb, unrelated to Destroyer. v33 attribution corrected."
  ],
  "boundaries": [
    "Missing native AHtc Cool1/Cast1/DataC1/DataD1/BuffID1. Immediate magic/spells damage and no imposed cooldown are host adapters, not verified native defaults. No invented slow or stun.",
    "mana0 absent in source table; current importer manaStart0 retained. Not independently verified native inheritance.",
    "Source CreateUnit callbacks, Warcraft group/handle lifecycle, birth collision/tech stats and start-location mapping need native validation.",
    "A0SB hatchling death explosion still uses the existing host implementation; full independent death elseif priority not covered by this batch.",
    "Old snapshots lack pre-upgrade source event history; absent counters begin0 and are not reconstructed from guessed attacks."
  ]
